#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:635
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Enter the URL you want to use for searching unknown numbers. Include "
"'{number}' in the URL where the caller's phone number should go.\n"
"\n"
"For example: https://mysearch.com/?q={number}\n"
"\n"
"When you tap the search button during a call, we will replace '{number}' "
"with the actual phone number and open it in your default browser."
msgstr ""
"Fier de URL yn dy't jo brûke wolle foar it sykjen fan ûnbekende nûmers. "
"Omfetsje '{number}' yn 'e URL wêr't it tillefoannûmer fan de beller hinne "
"moat.\n"
"\n"
"Bygelyks: https://mysearch.com/?q={number}\n"
"\n"
"As jo op de sykknop tikje tidens in oprop, sille wy '{number}' ferfange "
"troch it werklike telefoannûmer en iepenje it yn jo standertbrowser."

