#: src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:142
msgid "Enable Feature"
msgstr "Funksje ynskeakelje"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:171
msgid ""
"Contacts can trigger an action by sending a secret SMS message. Add contacts "
"below and set their secret trigger phrase."
msgstr ""
"Kontakten kinne in aksje útlizze troch in geheim SMS-berjocht te "
"ferstjoeren. Foegje kontakten hjirûnder ta en set har geheime trigger-sin yn."

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:174
msgid ""
"Trusted contacts can request your location by sending a secret SMS message. "
"TOTP is mandatory for this feature to work. Add contacts below and set their "
"secret trigger phrase. Example template: 'SECRET TOTP' Real life example: "
"'Gorilla 123456'"
msgstr ""
"Fertroude kontakten kinne jo lokaasje oanfreegje troch in geheim SMS-"
"berjocht te ferstjoeren. TOTP is ferplicht foar dizze funksje om te wurkjen. "
"Foegje hjirûnder kontakten ta en set harren geheime trigger-sin. "
"Foarbyldsjabloan: 'SECRET TOTP' Foarbyld yn it echte libben: 'Gorilla 123456'"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:177
msgid ""
"Trusted contacts can silently trigger a callback by sending a secret SMS "
"message. TOTP is mandatory for this feature to work. Add contacts below and "
"set their secret trigger phrase. Example template: 'SECRET TOTP' Real life "
"example: 'Gorilla 123456'"
msgstr ""
"Fertroude kontakten kinne stilwei in werombelaksje útlizze troch in geheim "
"SMS-berjocht te ferstjoeren. TOTP is ferplicht foar dizze funksje om te "
"wurkjen. Foegje hjirûnder kontakten ta en set harren geheime trigger-sin. "
"Foarbyldsjabloan: 'SECRET TOTP' Foarbyld yn it echte libben: 'Gorilla 123456'"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:180
msgid ""
"Trusted contacts can send an SMS relay. TOTP is mandatory for this feature "
"to work. Add contacts below and set their secret trigger phrase. Example "
"template: 'SECRET TOTP +1234567890 MESSAGE' Real life example: 'Gorilla "
"123456 +1234567890 Hello'"
msgstr ""
"Fertroude kontakten kinne in SMS-relais stjoere. TOTP is ferplicht foar "
"dizze funksje om te wurkjen. Foegje hjirûnder kontakten ta en set harren "
"geheime trigger-sin. Foarbyldsjabloan: 'SECRET TOTP +1234567890 MESSAGE' "
"Foarbyld yn it echte libben: 'Gorilla 123456 +1234567890 Hello'"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:183
msgid ""
"Trusted contacts can start a tmate SSH session and receive the SSH access "
"string by sending a secret SMS message. TOTP is mandatory for this feature "
"to work. Add contacts below and set their secret trigger phrase. Example "
"template: 'SECRET TOTP' Real life example: 'Gorilla 123456'"
msgstr ""
"Fertroude kontakten kinne in tmate SSH-sesje begjinne en de SSH-tagongssnaar "
"ûntfange troch in geheim SMS-berjocht te ferstjoeren. TOTP is ferplicht foar "
"dizze funksje om te wurkjen. Foegje hjirûnder kontakten ta en set harren "
"geheime trigger-sin. Foarbyldsjabloan: 'SECRET TOTP' Foarbyld yn it echte "
"libben: 'Gorilla 123456'"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:186
msgid ""
"Trusted contacts can lock your device: the SIM PIN is changed to a new one "
"and locked, and the phone powers off. TOTP is mandatory for this feature to "
"work. Add contacts below and set their secret trigger phrase. Example "
"template: 'SECRET TOTP SIM_CURRENT_PIN SIM_NEW_PIN SUDO_PASSWORD' Real life "
"example: 'Gorilla 123456 0000 1234 SupportYourLocalFootball'"
msgstr ""
"Fertroude kontakten kinne jo apparaat beskoattelje: de SIM-PIN wurdt feroare "
"yn in nijen en beskoattele, en de telefoan giet út. TOTP is ferplicht foar "
"dizze funksje om te wurkjen. Foegje hjirûnder kontakten ta en set harren "
"geheime trigger-sin. Foarbyldsjabloan: 'SECRET TOTP SIM_CURRENT_PIN "
"SIM_NEW_PIN SUDO_PASSWORD' Foarbyld yn it echte libben: 'Gorilla 123456 0000 "
"1234 SupportYourLocalFootball'"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:303
msgid "View or edit TOTP"
msgstr "TOTP besjen of bewurkje"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:305
msgid "Setup TOTP"
msgstr "TOTP ynstelle"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:380
msgid "Secret message"
msgstr "Geheim berjocht"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:392
msgid "Remove Contact"
msgstr "Kontakt fuortsmite"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:416
msgid "Contact removed (Click Save to commit)"
msgstr "Kontakt fuortsmiten (klik op Bewarje om te begean)"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:490
msgid "Contact already in trusted list"
msgstr "Kontakt al yn fertroude list"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:504
msgid "Contact added"
msgstr "Kontakt tafoege"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:522
msgid "TOTP Setup"
msgstr "TOTP-ynstelling"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:568
msgid ""
"Share this code with your trusted contact. They should add it to an "
"authenticator app such as Gnome Authenticator.\n"
"\n"
"If entering manually, ensure the following settings:\n"
"• Algorithm: SHA1\n"
"• Digits: 6\n"
"• Interval: 60 seconds\n"
"\n"
"Each action has its own code. When triggering an action by SMS, they must "
"append the current 6-digit code from their authenticator after the keyword."
msgstr ""
"Diel dizze koade mei jo fertroude kontaktpersoan. Se moatte it tafoegje oan "
"in autentikaasje-app lykas Gnome Authenticator.\n"
"\n"
"As jo ​​hânmjittich ynfiere, soargje foar de folgjende ynstellingen:\n"
"• Algoritme: SHA1\n"
"• Sifers: 6\n"
"• Ynterfal: 60 sekonden\n"
"\n"
"Elke aksje hat in eigen koade. By it iepenjen fan in aksje fia SMS, moatte "
"se de aktuele 6-siferige koade fan har authenticator taheakje nei it "
"kaaiwurd."

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:597
msgid "Copy TOTP key"
msgstr "TOTP-kaai kopiearje"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:608
#: src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:650
msgid "Regenerate"
msgstr "Regenerate"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:615
msgid "Remove current TOTP"
msgstr "Hjoeddeistige TOTP fuortsmite"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:624
msgid "Remove TOTP Key?"
msgstr "TOTP-kaai fuortsmite?"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:625
msgid ""
"Are you sure you want to remove the TOTP key? This action will disable TOTP "
"verification for this feature."
msgstr ""
"Binne jo wis dat jo de TOTP-kaai fuortsmite wolle? Dizze aksje sil TOTP-"
"ferifikaasje foar dizze funksje útskeakelje."

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:645
msgid "Regenerate Code?"
msgstr "Koade opnij oanmeitsje?"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:646
msgid ""
"This will invalidate the current code in your contact's authenticator app. "
"Are you sure?"
msgstr ""
"Dit sil de hjoeddeistige koade yn 'e authenticator-app fan jo kontakt "
"ûnjildich meitsje. Bisto wis?"

